IG=[
 ('Account Status','https://help.instagram.com/338481628002750','In the app: Settings, then Account Status. Shows removed posts, features you are blocked from and, where offered, a Request a review button. Check it before anything else if you can still log in.'),
 ('Disabled Instagram accounts','https://help.instagram.com/366993040048856','Meta’s help page for disabled accounts. If your account is disabled you see a message as soon as you log in, and the appeal starts from that message, not from a separate form.'),
 ('Hacked Instagram account','https://www.instagram.com/hacked/','For a login that stopped working with no disabled or suspended message, or an email, phone or username that changed without you.'),
 ('Accounts Center','https://accountscenter.instagram.com/','Password, two-factor, devices that are logged in and linked Facebook profiles. Some reviews and identity checks now open from here.'),
 ('Instagram Help Center','https://help.instagram.com/','Searchable help. Useful for reading the rule named in your notice, not for appealing.'),
]
